    "text": "Since the given numbers are in AP, we get,<br />&nbsp;&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8658;</mo> <msub> <mtext>log</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msup> <mn>3</mn> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>x</mtext> </mrow> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <msub> <mtext>log</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mn>3</mn> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mtext>log</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>4.3</mtext> <mtext>x</mtext> </msup> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br />Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></ma